            Great happy song from Kylie ! Track #2 on her album 'Aphrodite'.

The intro might be a bit pain in the ass 'cause it's originally played
by a piano, but once you get the speed an rhythm, it sounds really good !
Hope you like it ! =)

The Chorus is the same as the intro, and it was a huge job to get the
accuracy, and it's not 100% now but I really hope you get the idea !

